title    Night Highway
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Title theme option "highway": a cruising synth-brass hook in E-flat major over an octave FM slap bass, gated snare and tom fills, doubled by a supersaw in the chorus. The last eight bars lift a tone, to F major.
tempo    138
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.28

voice lead   synbrass  vol=0.68 bright=1.3
voice dbl    supersaw  vol=0.32 oct=-1 pan=0.1
voice keys   vibes     vol=0.32 pan=0.4 center=G4 gate=0.7
voice pad    pad       vol=0.24 pan=-0.35 center=G4
